==Trivia==
[[File:ElectrodeGeneticApex235 artwork.png|thumb|Standalone illustration]]
The illustration rare print of this card features [[Kanto]]'s [[Kanto Power Plant|Power Plant]], with {{p|Zapdos}} flying in the background. In {{LGPE}}, the Power Plant contains four {{p|Electrode}} posing as fake [[item ball]]s, which are also depicted in the illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Electrode|39}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*{{m|Electro Ball}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Electrode}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

